From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tung Huynh <tung75605@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:22:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] win32: build: allow packaging when -z (DISABLEGUI) is set

VLC 3.0.24 clears INSTALLER when -z is passed, which skips
`make package-win32` in UWP builds (`-z -r -u -w`).

---
 extras/package/win32/build.sh | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/extras/package/win32/build.sh b/extras/package/win32/build.sh
--- a/extras/package/win32/build.sh
+++ b/extras/package/win32/build.sh
@@ -125,7 +125,6 @@ case $ARCH in
 esac
 
 if [ -n "$DISABLEGUI" ]; then
-    INSTALLER=""
     I18N=""
 fi
 
-- 
2.54.0.windows.1
